sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Client
  participant Gateway
  participant Safety
  participant Orchestrator
  participant Knowledge
  participant LLM
  participant Voice
  participant Avatar

  User->>Client: Speak or type
  Client->>Gateway: Authenticated turn + consent context
  Gateway->>Safety: Fast pre-generation risk scan
  Safety-->>Gateway: Risk tier + required policy
  Gateway->>Orchestrator: Turn, session state, safety state
  Orchestrator->>Knowledge: Retrieve approved evidence/resources
  Knowledge-->>Orchestrator: Cited context
  Orchestrator->>LLM: Constrained response plan
  LLM-->>Orchestrator: Draft response + structured metadata
  Orchestrator->>Safety: Post-generation safety validation
  Safety-->>Orchestrator: Approve, rewrite, or crisis template
  Orchestrator->>Voice: Approved text + locale + voice
  Voice-->>Avatar: Audio + phoneme/timing stream
  Avatar-->>Client: Rendered facial/lip animation
  Client-->>User: Text, audio, and visual response
